@Endpoint=http://localhost:11430
#@Endpoint=http://localhost:8080
@Resource=https://management.azure.com//.default

### Cloud shell request
POST {{Endpoint}}/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Metadata: true

resource={{Resource}}

### Virtual machine request
GET {{Endpoint}}/metadata/identity/oauth2/token?api-version=2018-02-01&resource={{Resource}}
Metadata: true

### OAuth2 token request
POST {{Endpoint}}/oauth2/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

scope={{Resource}}

### Authenticated request
GET https://management.azure.com/subscriptions?api-version=2020-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("msal")}}

